On Wed, Mar 17, 2004 at 05:17:36PM +0100, Poizot Emmanuel wrote:
> Hi,
> does any body ever used r.in.hdf command.
> I'm working with grass 5 and seems to do not have this command install.
> How can I do it ?

r.in.gdal with a recent GDAL version (1.2) supports HDF.
r.in.hdf is no longer supported.

Regards

 Markus Neteler


